- Support mailbox-derived expiry payouts.
  Retire authenticated payout commitments as spent and exclude them from Ark
  balance. Recovery reports these VTXOs as skipped. Optional fallback status
  is a last-observed display; the bitcoin wallet tracks actual payout outputs.
  [#3](https://github.com/BullishNode/scuttle/pull/3)
- Accept an application-supplied mailbox key through `WalletSeed`.
  Check the stored public identity when the wallet opens. Applications must
  back up an external private key; the Ark seed alone cannot restore it.
  On payout servers, the default mailbox uses BIP86 external index zero.
  [#3](https://github.com/BullishNode/scuttle/pull/3)
- Report a transfer refused for an expiry payout as failed delivery.
  The refusal does not create a successful payment or another Ark debit.
  [#3](https://github.com/BullishNode/scuttle/pull/3)
